connected
Core\Net::connect cannot connect to 127.0.0.2: it is loopback (127.0.0.0/8), which `net.internal` does not except
help: add `internal = ["127.0.0.2"]` under `[capabilities.net]` in nvs.toml
Core\Net::listen needs the capability `net.listen` for 127.0.0.1:8080, which is not granted
help: add `listen = ["127.0.0.1:8080"]` under `[capabilities.net]` in nvs.toml
